eration of its largest windpower project - 350-MW Frontier II in Oklahoma', 'text': 'CHARLOTTE, N.C., MARCH 16, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0DUKE ENERGY RENEWABLES, A COMMERCIAL BUSINESS UNIT OF DUKE ENERGY (NYSE: DUK), TODAY ANNOUNCED THE COMMERCIAL OPERATION OF THE LARGEST WINDPOWER PROJECT IN ITS FLEET – THE 350-MEGAWATT (MW) FRONTIER WINDPOWER II PROJECT\xa0IN KAY COUNTY, OKLA.'}{'symbol': 'XOM', 'date': '2021-03-16 09:45:00-04:56', 'title': 'ExxonMobil Files Definitive Proxy and Shareholder Letter Urging Support for Directors', 'text': 'IRVING, TEXAS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--EXXONMOBIL FILES DEFINITIVE PROXY AND SHAREHOLDER LETTER URGING SUPPORT FOR DIRECTORS'}{'symbol': 'XOM', 'date': '2021-03-16 08:00:00-04:56', 'title': 'INVESTOR ACTION NOTICE: The Schall Law Firm Announces the Filing of a Class Action Lawsuit Against Exxon Mobil Corporation and Encourages Investors with Losses in Excess of $500,000 to Contact the Firm', 'text': 'LOS ANGELES, CALIFORNIA--(NEWSFILE CORP. - MARCH 15, 2021) - THE SCHALL LAW FIRM, A NATIONAL SHAREHOLDER RIGHTS LITIGATION FIRM, ANNOUNCES THE FILING OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST EXXON MOBIL CORPORATION ("EXXON" OR "THE COMPANY") (NYSE: XOM) FOR VIOLATIONS OF §§10(B) AND 20(A) OF THE SECURITIES EXCHANGE ACT OF 1934 AND RULE 10B-5 PROMULGATED THEREUNDER BY THE U.S. SECURITIES AND EXCHANGE COMMISSION.INVESTORS WHO PURCHASED THE COMPANY\'S SECURITIES BETWEEN NOVEMBER 6, 2019 AND JANUARY 14, 2021,...'}{'symbol': 'FB', 'date': '2021-03-16 06:00:00-04:56', 'title': "Mark Zuckerberg Announces Facebook's Plans To Help Get People Vaccinated Against COVID-19", 'text': 'MENLO PARK, CALIF., MARCH 15, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0MARK ZUCKERBERG, FACEBOOK FOUNDER AND CEO, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT FACEBOOK, INC. (NASDAQ: FB) PLANS TO HELP PEOPLE GET VACCINATED AGAINST THE COVID-19 VIRUS.'}{'symbol': 'FE', 'date': '2021-03-16 14:01:00-04:56', 'title': 'FirstEnergy Corp. Declares Unchanged Common Stock Dividend', 'text': 'AKRON, OHIO, MARCH 16, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -